--
libc++ (LLVM 18) std::__bind_back (the core of std::views::take): the calls
compute the right values, but two __tuple_impl(_Tuple &&) bodies
(tuple:488) are dropped.  Smaller: with `struct at {};', even
`std::is_constructible_v<std::tuple<at, std::tuple<int>>,
const std::tuple<at, std::tuple<int>> &, std::tuple<int> &&>' is false as
it should be but drops both bodies, reached through is_convertible<const
tuple &, tuple> (tuple:680) and a tuple<int> constructor template.
clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its
WRONG assertion.
